stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> UNDERSTANDING
    UNDERSTANDING --> PLANNING
    PLANNING --> PREFLIGHT
    PREFLIGHT --> WAITING_FOR_USER: Need missing information
    PREFLIGHT --> WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL: Risky action
    PREFLIGHT --> RUNNING: Ready
    WAITING_FOR_USER --> RUNNING: User answers
    WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL --> RUNNING: User approves
    WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED: User rejects
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: Execute next step
    RUNNING --> RECOVERING: Crash / restart
    RECOVERING --> RUNNING: Checkpoint found
    RECOVERING --> FAILED: Cannot recover
    RUNNING --> PARTIAL_SUCCESS: Some criteria pass
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED_UNVERIFIED: Work ended, evidence incomplete
    RUNNING --> SUCCESS_VERIFIED: All criteria and evidence pass
    RUNNING --> TASK_FAILED_RESULT_MISMATCH: Output does not match goal
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: User cancels
    SUCCESS_VERIFIED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    PARTIAL_SUCCESS --> [*]
    COMPLETED_UNVERIFIED --> [*]
    TASK_FAILED_RESULT_MISMATCH --> [*]
